# apv_trace's plain_project fixture (task 18) intentionally has a REAL
# file nested under a directory literally named `.venv/lib/` -- it's what
# proves FunctionTracer's virtualenv-directory filter works. Git won't
# apply a file-level negation inside a directory it already ignored, so
# the directory itself needs negating too.
!packages/apv_trace/tests/fixtures/plain_project/.venv/
!packages/apv_trace/tests/fixtures/plain_project/.venv/lib/
!packages/apv_trace/tests/fixtures/plain_project/.venv/lib/fake_lib.py

